  "description": "John Coyne Estates are delighted to present to the market this pristine Two Bed Mid Terrace Property boasting a floor area in the region of 907 sq.ft. Ground floor accommodation briefly comprises: kitchen/dining room, utility, living room, guest w/c. The first floor consists of two large double bedrooms (master en-suite) and bathroom. Externally, there is a good sized rear garden with veranda and pedestrian access.\n\nCarrick Hall is ideally situated in the town centre, within walking distance a host of amenities including, schools, shops, restaurants, banks, leading supermarket chains and bus stop. Just 20 mins from M4 motorway and Enfield train station. Great daily bus services to Dublin and Tullamore. Ideal choice for any commuter. Ideal starter home/ Investment property. \n\nViewing of this stunning property is highly recommended.\n\n\nAccommodation:\n\nHallway: c.1.38m x c.1.57m \nWith ceramic floor tiles.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: c.4.13m x c.3.31m \nWith ceramic tiles, fitted units at both eye and floor level, integrated dishwasher, fridge freezer, integrated oven & hob, extractor fan, double doors to living room and patio doors leading to raised decked area and rear garden. \n\nUtility: c.2.13m x c.1.03m \nWith ceramic tiles and washing machine.\n\nGuest WC: c.1.97m x c.1.00m \nWith tiled floor, WC & WHB. \n\nLiving Room: c.5.40m x c.3.32m \nLarge reception room, open fire with cast iron insert and laminate flooring.\n\nUpstairs\n\nMaster Bedroom: c.3.63m x c.3.46m \nLarge double bedroom with high quality fitted wardrobes and carpet floor covering.\nEn– suite: c.1.08m x c.2.70m \nWith tiled floor, power shower, WC & Whb.\n\nBedroom 2: c.3.50m x c.3.88m \nLarge double bedroom with front facing aspect, fitted wardrobes and carpet floor covering.\n\nBathroom: c.2.21x c.2.08 \nWith exquisite tiling, bath, WC & WHB.\n\nRear Garden\nOne of the great features is the large back garden with pedestrian access and veranda.\n\nFeatures include:\nCarpet, blinds and light fittings included\nOil fired central heating\nDouble glazed PVC Windows\nLarge rear Garden with veranda.\nRear gate access\nLocated in quite cul-de –sac\nNot overlooked\n\nThe above particulars are issued by John Coyne Estates on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies.",
